<https://mlsysbook.ai/taxonomy/mlsys.collection.objectives> skos:member <https://mlsysbook.ai/taxonomy/mlsys.latency-budget> .
<https://mlsysbook.ai/taxonomy/mlsys.collection.objectives> skos:member <https://mlsysbook.ai/taxonomy/mlsys.workload-trace> .
<https://mlsysbook.ai/taxonomy/mlsys.collection.objectives> skos:member <https://mlsysbook.ai/taxonomy/mlsys.cost-sensitive-decision> .
<https://mlsysbook.ai/taxonomy/mlsys.collection.objectives> skos:member <https://mlsysbook.ai/taxonomy/mlsys.pareto-frontier> .
<https://mlsysbook.ai/taxonomy/mlsys.collection.objectives> skos:member <https://mlsysbook.ai/taxonomy/mlsys.efficiency-frontier> .
<https://mlsysbook.ai/taxonomy/mlsys.collection.objectives> skos:member <https://mlsysbook.ai/taxonomy/mlsys.recovery-objectives> .

