<https://mlsysbook.ai/taxonomy/mlsys.collection.data> skos:member <https://mlsysbook.ai/taxonomy/mlsys.storage-tiering> .
<https://mlsysbook.ai/taxonomy/mlsys.collection.data> skos:member <https://mlsysbook.ai/taxonomy/mlsys.weak-supervision> .
<https://mlsysbook.ai/taxonomy/mlsys.collection.data> skos:member <https://mlsysbook.ai/taxonomy/mlsys.active-learning> .
<https://mlsysbook.ai/taxonomy/mlsys.collection.data> skos:member <https://mlsysbook.ai/taxonomy/mlsys.annotator-agreement> .
