<https://mlsysbook.ai/taxonomy/mlsys.collection.data> skos:member <https://mlsysbook.ai/taxonomy/mlsys.data-mixture> .
<https://mlsysbook.ai/taxonomy/mlsys.collection.data> skos:member <https://mlsysbook.ai/taxonomy/mlsys.synthetic-data> .
<https://mlsysbook.ai/taxonomy/mlsys.collection.data> skos:member <https://mlsysbook.ai/taxonomy/mlsys.data-augmentation> .
<https://mlsysbook.ai/taxonomy/mlsys.collection.data> skos:member <https://mlsysbook.ai/taxonomy/mlsys.data-validation> .
